ter[1], lower_z, approach=app_choice, finger_axis=fa_choice, path=\"line\")\n    else:\n        # Fallback to vertical descent\n        lower_until_contact()\n\n    open_gripper()\n    retreat(dz=0.15)\n    go_home()\n    check(pen_name, holder_name)",
